# Suppressions of ThreadSanitizer for the thread tests. tools/tsan.sh
# uses this file.
#
# The stop flag of a thread: stopWorker stores zero in mem_limit of the
# interpreter of another thread, and the safe points of that thread
# read mem_limit with a plain load. docs/threads.md describes the
# order. The report of this pair has stopWorker in the stack of the
# store.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
race:thread.stopWorker
